                            <textarea rows="3" class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs bg-slate-50/50 dark:bg-[#18262c] border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl focus:border-[#009488] focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500/20 focus:outline-none text-slate-900 dark:text-white transition-all">Fees once deposited are strictly non-refundable and non-transferable under any circumstances. In case of duplicate payment, kindly submit proof within 7 working days.</textarea>
